{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","竹破苍穹"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","蒼穹破"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","盘坐后对周围敌人造成伤害，之后消耗能量维持“苍竹劲”状态，在“苍竹劲”状态中自身获得攻击力和急速加成，同时解锁技能“封天掌”对单体敌人造成高额伤害并使目标不能恢复能量。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","胡坐の姿勢を取った後、周囲の敵にダメージを与える。その後、SPを消費して「蒼竹勁」状態を維持。「蒼竹勁」状態の間、自身の攻撃力と速度UP、スキル「封天掌」が使用可能になる。「封天掌」は敵1体に大ダメージを与え、一定時間、対象はSP回復不可になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","潘撑起竹竿盘坐运行体内的真气，盘坐结束后体内真气爆发，对附近2格范围的敌人造成350% + 50% ATK的伤害，随后自身将进入“苍竹劲”状态，并且每秒需要消耗150点能量来维持该状态。本技能释放期间，潘获得霸体。 \n处于“苍竹劲”状态时，潘获得60急速和17%攻击力加成，并解锁技能“封天掌”：蓄力后双掌交替拍向对方共7次，每次造成70% ATK的伤害，最后一击伤害增加至150% ATK并使目标眩晕1.5秒；在最后一击时封印其真气流动，使非首领敌人5秒内无法恢复能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","竹竿を立て、胡坐の姿勢で真気を練る。胡坐の姿勢を解くと真気が爆発し、周囲2マス以内の敵に350% + 50% ATKのダメージを与える。その後、自身は「蒼竹勁」状態になり、毎秒150のSPを消費してこの状態を維持。このスキルの発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる \n「蒼竹勁」状態の間、自身の速度+60、攻撃力+17%、スキル「封天掌」が使用可能になる。「封天掌」：力を溜め、敵1体に左右交互に掌底突きを7回繰り出し、掌底突き1回につき70% ATKのダメージを与え、最後のひと突きのダメージが150% ATKにUPし、対象に1.5秒間のスタンを付与。最後のひと突きは相手の真気の流れを封じ、5秒間、ボスを除く敵はSP回復不可になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":104,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":167,"end":174,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":187,"end":195,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":120,"end":128,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":220,"end":227,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":249,"end":257,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至380% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至19%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","真気爆発のダメージが380% + 50% ATKにUPし、「蒼竹勁」状態の間の攻撃力上昇量が19%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至410% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至21%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","真気爆発のダメージが410% + 50% ATKにUPし、「蒼竹勁」状態の間の攻撃力上昇量が21%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至440% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至23%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","真気爆発のダメージが440% + 50% ATKにUPし、「蒼竹勁」状態の間の攻撃力上昇量が23%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至470% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至25%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","真気爆発のダメージが470% + 50% ATKにUPし、「蒼竹勁」状態の間の攻撃力上昇量が25%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","青虹贯日"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","青虹貫日"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","重击敌人造成较高伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵を強く攻撃し、大ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","潘重击目标头部，对目标造成300% + 40% ATK伤害；处于“苍竹劲”状态时本技能还会造成目标当前生命值12%的额外伤害，额外伤害不会超过自身240% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","対象の頭部を強く攻撃し、対象に300% + 40% ATKのダメージを与える。「蒼竹勁」状態の場合、追加で対象の現在HP×12%のダメージを与える。追加ダメージはパンの240% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":73,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":84,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至320% + 40% ATK，处于“苍竹劲”状态下造成的额外伤害提高至目标当前生命值的13%，最高不会超过自身260% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが320% + 40% ATKにUP。「蒼竹勁」状態の間、追加ダメージは対象の現在HP×13%にUPし、パンの260% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至340% + 40% ATK，处于“苍竹劲”状态下造成的额外伤害提高至目标当前生命值的14%，最高不会超过自身280% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが340% + 40% ATKにUP。「蒼竹勁」状態の間、追加ダメージは対象の現在HP×14%にUPし、パンの280% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至360% + 40% ATK，处于“苍竹劲”状态下造成的额外伤害提高至目标当前生命值的15%，最高不会超过自身300% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが360% + 40% ATKにUP。「蒼竹勁」状態の間、追加ダメージは対象の現在HP×15%にUPし、パンの300% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","苍竹御敌"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","蒼竹護身術"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自己施加护盾，在护盾持续时间内获得霸体，在护盾结束、被打破或叠加时对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身はシールドを獲得し、シールドの存在期間中、所持者はスーパーアーマー状態になる。シールドが消失した時、破壊された時、または重複する時、敵にダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时蓄力，之后获得一个340% + 40% ATK的苍竹护盾持续9秒，苍竹护盾存在时提供霸体效果。当苍竹护盾消失、被打破或与已有的苍竹护盾叠加时，将幻化成绿叶飞向当前攻击的目标，对其造成潘210% + 30% ATK的伤害；蓄力过程中潘处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：力を溜めてから、340% + 40% ATK分の蒼竹シールドを9秒間獲得。蒼竹シールドの存在期間中、所持者はスーパーアーマー状態になる。蒼竹シールドが消失した時、破壊された時、または既存の蒼竹シールドと重複する時、竹葉で攻撃中の対象に自身の210% + 30% ATKのダメージを与える。力溜めの間、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":101,"end":107,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":132,"end":138,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":47,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":97,"end":111,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":123,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":62,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":128,"end":142,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":161,"end":169,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾量提升至380% + 40% ATK，绿叶造成的伤害提升至230% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","獲得するシールド値が380% + 40% ATKにUPし、竹葉のダメージが230% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"